    "title": "AKU organises National Health Sciences Research Symposium",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "A National Health Sciences Research Symposium themed 'Injury in the Developing World - from Prevention to Care' is being organised by Aga Khan University in Karachi (AKU).",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "11d4aa2e578851b1",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "659-BannerImage.jpg",
