    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A National Health Sciences Research Symposium themed 'Injury in the Developing World - from Prevention to Care' is being organised by Aga Khan University in Karachi (AKU). The event is scheduled for October 24 and 25, 2007 and will also feature pre- and post- symposium workshops."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The symposium would be of professional interest to practising health professionals as well as to researchers, investigators and students. Speakers have been invited from North America, Europe, India , and the Middle East along with local distinguished local speakers. The University encourages the sharing of research findings at different sessions of the Symposium, whose goals and objectives are:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The promotion of injury prevention and care as an integral part of local and national public health policies and programmes; "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To share state-of-the-art research and practices in all fields of injury trauma care at national and regional level; "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To foster partnerships between professionals working in the field of injury prevention and trauma care at local, national and regional levels; "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To discuss ways to enhance emergency preparedness and disaster management. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Abstracts are invited from Pakistan and overseas: Abstract sub-themes include:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Trauma Care and Rehabilitation:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Medical and nursing care of head/neck, "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Orthopedics, thoracic and abdominal and obstetrical injuries "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Emergency response system "
